        "580. 根据式$\\frac{1}{z}=\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{1}{y}$，分别把每个变量用另外两个变量表",
        "示出来。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "581",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "581. 化简：",
        "а) $(ab^{-1}-a^{-1}b)\\cdot(a-b)^{-1}$； б) $(x^{-2}-y^{-2})\\cdot(x+y)^{-1}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "582",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "582. 函数$f$由下列叙述给出：“每个自然数对应于这个数除",
        "以$5$的余数”。",
        "求$f(8)$，$f(32)$，$f(45)$，$f(104)$，$f(321)$。",
        "集合$N$映射到什么集合上？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "583",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "583. 已知函数$f(x)=2-\\frac{1}{x}$，它的定义域是正数集合。",
        "求$f\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)$，$f(3)$，$f(10)$，$f(100)$。",
        "$1$、$\\frac{1}{2}$、$-1$、$3$是不是这个函数的值？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "25. 相 对 误 差"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设量得书的厚度$b$和书架的长度$l$（以厘米为单位）是：",
        "$b=6\\pm0.5$，$l=200\\pm0.5$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这两个度量结果都精确到$0.5$厘米。但是很明显，绝对",
        "误差$0.5$厘米与$6$厘米之比太大，而与$200$厘米之比较小，也",
        "就是说，后一次度量结果比前一次度量结果的质量要高。"
      ]
    },
